<view class="nutrition-page">
  <view class="nutrition-hero"><view class="hero-copy"><view class="kicker">GENTLE NUTRITION</view><view class="hero-title">均衡饮食记录</view><view class="hero-subtitle">不追求完美数字，只观察今天如何照顾了自己。</view></view><image src="/assets/tutu-eating-painted.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view>
  <view class="range-tabs"><view class="active">天</view><view>周</view><view>月</view><view>年</view></view>
  <view class="date-row"><button bindtap="previous">‹</button><view>{{dateText}}</view><button bindtap="next">›</button></view>
  <view class="tip"><view class="tip-icon">灯</view><text>记录用于帮助你观察饮食节律，不是医疗或减重处方。</text></view>
  <view class="summary-card"><view class="calorie-ring"><view><text>今天已记录</text><text class="calorie-number">{{calories}}</text><text>千卡 · {{percentage}}%</text></view></view><view class="numbers"><view><text>记录目标</text><text class="number">{{log.goal}} 千卡</text></view><view><text>尚余</text><text class="number">{{remaining}} 千卡</text></view><button bindtap="setGoal">调整目标</button></view><view class="macros"><view><text>蛋白质</text><text>{{protein}}g</text></view><view><text>脂肪</text><text>{{fat}}g</text></view><view><text>碳水化合物</text><text>{{carbs}}g</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="meal-card" wx:for="{{meals}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="meal"><view class="meal-head"><view><text class="meal-name">{{meal.name}}</text><text class="meal-hint">{{meal.hint}}</text></view><view class="meal-calorie">{{meal.calories}} 千卡</view></view><view class="food" wx:for="{{meal.foods}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="food"><view class="food-dot"></view><view class="food-copy"><text>{{food.name}}</text><text>{{food.amountText}}{{food.custom ? ' · 仅记录重量' : ' · ' + food.calories + ' 千卡'}}</text></view><button data-meal="{{meal.id}}" data-id="{{food.id}}" bindtap="removeFood">×</button></view><button class="add-meal" data-meal="{{meal.id}}" bindtap="openAdd">＋ {{meal.foods.length ? '继续添加' : '记录这一餐'}}</button></view>
  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showAdd}}" bindtap="closeAdd"><view class="food-modal" catchtap="noop"><view class="modal-handle"></view><view class="modal-title">添加食物</view><view class="search-box"><text>⌕</text><input value="{{search}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索常见食物" placeholder-class="small-placeholder"/></view>
    <view class="weight-card" wx:if="{{selectedFood}}"><view class="selected-name">{{selectedFood.name}}</view><view class="selected-info">{{selectedFood.calories}} 千卡 / 100克</view><view class="gram-row"><input type="digit" value="{{foodGrams}}" bindinput="setFoodGrams" placeholder="吃了多少克" placeholder-class="small-placeholder"/><text>克</text><button bindtap="confirmFood">确认添加</button></view></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="food-results"><view class="food-result" wx:for="{{foodResults}}" wx:key="name"><view><text class="result-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="result-info">{{item.calories}} 千卡 / 100克</text></view><button data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectFood">选择</button></view><view class="empty-result" wx:if="{{!foodResults.length}}">没有找到，可以在下方自定义记录</view></scroll-view>
    <view class="custom"><view class="custom-title">自定义记录</view><view class="custom-note">自定义条目只记录克数，不计入营养汇总。</view><input value="{{customName}}" bindinput="setCustomName" placeholder="食物名称" placeholder-class="small-placeholder"/><view class="custom-gram"><input type="digit" value="{{customGrams}}" bindinput="setCustomGrams" placeholder="吃了多少克" placeholder-class="small-placeholder"/><text>克</text></view><button bindtap="addCustom">添加自定义食物</button></view><button class="cancel" bindtap="closeAdd">取消</button>
  </view></view>
</view>
